      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T22:10:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Delete `\u0026\u0026 img_fmt !\u003d AOM_IMG_FMT_NV12`.\n\nIn libaom, `x_chroma_shift` and `y_chroma_shift` are both equal to 1 for NV12.",
      "revId": "0ed903ee59cfc1b7dbab950f4e0d1445b14148b4",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
