      },
      "lineNbr": 234,
      "author": {
        "id": 5020
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T23:31:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Delete `\u0026\u0026 img_fmt !\u003d AOM_IMG_FMT_NV12`.\n\u003e \n\u003e In libaom, `x_chroma_shift` and `y_chroma_shift` are both equal to 1 for NV12.\n\nThat\u0027s another difference from libvpx. I left a comment for Jerome earlier:\n\n*Jerome, this differs from libvpx. In libaom the V stride is set to 0:*\n\n*https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom/+/f9533e48f5e5f081d9598b62fc43780bf717037b/aom/src/aom_image.c#177*\n\n*It would be good if the libraries aligned on their definition of NV12.*",
      "parentUuid": "3f341c63_14fcaba0",
      "revId": "0ed903ee59cfc1b7dbab950f4e0d1445b14148b4",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "24f35562_56450fb6",
        "filename": "test/encode_api_test.cc",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
