      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T22:10:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "aom/aom_image_t has the following comment:\n\n```\n  /* planes[AOM_PLANE_V] \u003d NULL and stride[AOM_PLANE_V] \u003d 0 when fmt \u003d\u003d\n   * AOM_IMG_FMT_NV12 */\n```\n\nFor the `AOM_IMG_FMT_NV12` image format, `img.stride[AOM_PLANE_V]` should be left as 0.",
      "revId": "0ed903ee59cfc1b7dbab950f4e0d1445b14148b4",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
